  "description": "The Syphon is the new evolution of the T-140. Click here to see the new Whyte Syphon\n\nConquer it all\nOur T-140 S is our best value, most versatile full-suspension bike to help you unlock every bit of fun from any trail. Whether you’re embarking on epic long rides, taming technical trails, or smashing singletrack at the trail centre, it's balanced and confidence-inspiring handling will help you conquer it all more capably – and more enjoyably – than ever before.\n\nHighlights\n– 140mm front and 135mm of rear suspension travel.\n– 6061 aluminium SCR framet with ISCG 2 guide mounts + geometry adjustment.\n– RockShox Pike Select 29in fork + Deluxe Select+ RT DebonAir shock.\n– Shimano Deore 12 speed transmission (32T chainring x 11-51T Sunrace cassette).\n– 29in trail-smoothing wheels front and rear.\n– Can be converted to MX wheels (29er front, 27.5in rear) for a more gravity-focused ride.",
